### Check process health without GitHub or database I/O
# @name getProcessHealth
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/health
X-Request-ID: httpyac-process-health

### Check the separate authenticated-storage readiness signal
# @name getDatabaseHealth
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/health/database
X-Request-ID: httpyac-database-health

### [negative] Reject an untrusted browser origin
# @name rejectUntrustedHealthOrigin
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/api/health
Origin: https://untrusted.example
X-Request-ID: httpyac-health-reject-origin
